<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italian 30-yr BTP sale.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italian 30-yr BTP sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for an 11th tranche of 2.0 trillion lire worth of 30-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) with a 7.25 pct coupon.</p>
<p>		     Nov 1, 2026	    Pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	 6.36 pct		 7.00</p>
<p> Gross Yield     7.29 pct		 7.99</p>
<p> Assigned price 100.95		   93.20</p>
<p> Bids	     2.758 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 2.000 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with a previous auction on May 29.</p>
</text>
